01:05:20.900 --> 01:05:25.140
They are all going together,

01:05:25.380 --> 01:05:29.500
They all are going to the poisoning,

01:05:30.180 --> 01:05:33.140
Because you are a Jew!

01:05:34.060 --> 01:05:36.820
Cry, my heart, cry,

01:05:37.300 --> 01:05:40.540
My heart, don't just say

01:05:41.380 --> 01:05:44.100
That you are a Jew!

01:05:49.460 --> 01:05:52.020
